## 3. Publishing Strategy

### 3.1 Independent Developer Collaborations

To strengthen our publishing arm, DIGI plans to partner with independent developers. These collaborations will enable us to diversify our portfolio and tap into niche markets. Notable partners include:

- **Pixel Dreams Studios (Los Angeles, CA)**
- **Quantum Leap Games (Austin, TX)**

### 3.2 Distribution Platforms

DIGI will distribute its titles through various platforms, including:

- **PC:** Steam, Epic Games Store
- **Consoles:** PlayStation 5, Xbox Series X
- **Mobile:** Apple App Store, Google Play Store

### 3.3 Marketing Strategy

A robust marketing campaign will be launched 6 months prior to the game release, utilizing social media, influencer partnerships, and targeted ads. Key marketing partners include:

- **Influencer:** Mark "GamerGuy" Johnson
- **Marketing Agency:** Creative Minds Agency

