- **Microsoft Xbox**

### 5.3 Industry Organizations

DIGI is a proud member of the Entertainment Software Association (ESA) and will actively participate in events such as the Game Developers Conference (GDC) and Electronic Entertainment Expo (E3) to foster industry relationships.

